# Bihar Election Analysis Dashboard - Project Structure

## Project Overview
This is a Next.js 15+ application for Bihar Election 2025 Analysis Dashboard System with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Redux Toolkit.

## Key Architecture Components

### Authentication System
- **Login**: Users authenticate with unique alphanumeric/numeric IDs (not email)
- **SUPER ADMIN**: Can create and manage all system users
- **Role-Based Access**: Different roles with specific permissions
- **Protected Routes**: Automatic redirect to login for unauthenticated users

### Main Entry Points
- [src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx) - Root layout with providers
- [src/app/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/page.tsx) - Home page with auth redirect
- [src/app/login/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/login/page.tsx) - Public login page
- [src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx) - Protected dashboard layout

### Core Context & State
- [src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx](mdc:src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx) - Authentication context with user management
- [src/stores/app-store.ts](mdc:src/stores/app-store.ts) - Redux app state
- [src/stores/analysis-store.ts](mdc:src/stores/analysis-store.ts) - Redux analysis state

### Layout Components
- [src/components/layout/Header.tsx](mdc:src/components/layout/Header.tsx) - Main header with user menu
- [src/components/layout/HorizontalNav.tsx](mdc:src/components/layout/HorizontalNav.tsx) - Horizontal navigation
- [src/components/layout/ConditionalLayout.tsx](mdc:src/components/layout/ConditionalLayout.tsx) - Conditional layout wrapper

### Navigation & Menu
- [src/lib/menu-data.ts](mdc:src/lib/menu-data.ts) - Menu structure with role-based access
- [src/types/index.ts](mdc:src/types/index.ts) - TypeScript type definitions

### User Management (SUPER ADMIN only)
- [src/app/dashboard/user-management/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/dashboard/user-management/page.tsx) - User CRUD interface

## File Organization
- `/src/app/` - Next.js App Router pages
- `/src/components/` - Reusable React components
- `/src/contexts/` - React Context providers
- `/src/stores/` - Redux store slices
- `/src/lib/` - Utility functions and configurations
- `/src/types/` - TypeScript type definitions
- `/src/hooks/` - Custom React hooks
- `/public/` - Static assets (logo.png, etc.)

## Key Features
- **Unique ID Authentication**: Alphanumeric/numeric user IDs
- **Role-Based Access Control**: SUPER_ADMIN, ADMIN, PMT, QC, etc.
- **User Management**: SUPER ADMIN can create/edit/delete users
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-first with Tailwind CSS
- **Dark Mode**: Theme switching support
- **Protected Routes**: Automatic authentication checks